/* llms KB_THERMAL (apply_kb_thermal.py): the filler only OUTSIDE the GPU's thermal zone. A 1 Hz thread reads IOReport in process (dlopen, as throughput/ioreport_power.c): 'GPU Stats' / 'GPU Discrete Power Zone Residency' / PZRSDNCY, the SLOWCLTM share of the last second. Off unless set; =2 CANARY (inverted). */
