/* llms ANE_DENSE (apply_ane_dense.py): tier 1 of the dense wavefront -- a 128-row piece's q_a (norm folded), kv and q_b halves on the Neural Engine while the GPU runs the other piece's attention block. One hand-off per piece: the conversion on the batch command buffer, the batch committed, the command buffer's completion handler evaluating the four programs in order on a worker queue, the shared event D set from the CPU, end waiting on D. */
